/T (One interesting use case of Nexa is using it for paper tips. With paper tips, you send a small amount of money to an address, and print the corresponding private key on paper. Then you can hand out these pieces of paper as a tip or gift to people in person. In practice, however, people might not know what to do with these gifts or they might lose or forget about them.)
